  <diagram id="54lr89tYkwpWbEO5BqIn" name="Sequence_Diagram">
    <mxGraphModel grid="0" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1169" pageHeight="827" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\n%%{init: {\&quot;theme\&quot;: \&quot;base\&quot;, \&quot;themeVariables\&quot;: {\&quot;primaryColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;, \&quot;primaryTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;primaryBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;lineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;actorBkg\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;, \&quot;actorBorder\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;actorTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;actorLineColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;signalColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;signalTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;noteBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;, \&quot;noteBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;noteTextColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;labelBoxBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;, \&quot;labelBoxBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;, \&quot;activationBkgColor\&quot;: \&quot;#ffffff\&quot;, \&quot;activationBorderColor\&quot;: \&quot;#000000\&quot;}, \&quot;themeCSS\&quot;: \&quot;.actor-line { stroke: #000000 !important; stroke-width: 1px !important; stroke-dasharray: 5 5 !important; }\&quot;}}%%\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    actor P as Pedestrian\n    participant B as Button D2\n    participant PB as PedestrianButton\n    participant C as TrafficLightController\n    participant L as LED objects\n\n    Note over C,L: Initial state: GREEN\n\n    P-&gt;&gt;+B: press()\n    B-&gt;&gt;+PB: Hardware interrupt\n    PB-&gt;&gt;+PB: handleInterrupt()\n    Note over PB: pressPending = true\n    PB--&gt;&gt;-PB: return\n    PB--&gt;&gt;-B: Interrupt completed\n    B--&gt;&gt;-P: Button press registered\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;+C: update()\n    C-&gt;&gt;+PB: consumePress()\n    PB--&gt;&gt;-C: true\n    Note over C: crossingRequested = true\n\n    alt Pedestrian request received during GREEN\n        Note over C: Complete 10s car GREEN\n\n        C-&gt;&gt;+C: enterState(YELLOW)\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: greenLED.turnOff()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: yellowLED.turnOn()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C--&gt;&gt;-C: State changed to YELLOW\n\n        Note over C: Complete 5s YELLOW\n\n        C-&gt;&gt;+C: enterState(PEDESTRIAN_GREEN)\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: yellowLED.turnOff()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: redLED.turnOn()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: pedestrianRedLED.turnOff()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: pedestrianGreenLED.turnOn()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C--&gt;&gt;-C: State changed to PEDESTRIAN_GREEN\n\n        Note over C,L: Crossing request served\n        Note over C: Wait 10s crossing period\n\n        C-&gt;&gt;+C: enterState(RED)\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: pedestrianGreenLED.turnOff()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C-&gt;&gt;+L: pedestrianRedLED.turnOn()\n        L--&gt;&gt;-C: return\n        C--&gt;&gt;-C: State changed to RED\n\n    else No pedestrian request\n        Note over C: Continue normal traffic light cycle\n    end\n\n    C--&gt;&gt;-C: update() completed\n\n    Note over C,L: Normal RED state resumes after crossing\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="wFW9yKOmQp14kKRn52u2-1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <UserObject label="Pedestrian" mermaidId="n:P" mermaidBaseStyle="html=1;shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;edgeStyle&quot;:&quot;sequenceEdgeStyle&quot;,&quot;libavoidRouting&quot;:0,&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};lifelineDashed=0;strokeWidth=2;rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;lifelineColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;fontColor=#000000;participant=seqActorStick;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;spacingBottom=4;size=90;lifelineMirror=1;fontFamily=Trebuchet MS,Verdana,Arial,sans-serif;fontSize=16;shadow=1;shadowColor=#000000;shadowOffsetX=4;shadowOffsetY=4;shadowBlur=0;shadowOpacity=6;" mermaidBaseValue="Pedestrian" id="wFW9yKOmQp14kKRn52u2-2">
